1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,000
People live through meaningful and difficult moments inside digital systems.

2
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:15,000
But when the moment gets hard, Scripture is usually somewhere else.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Scripture Everywhere AI is one shared context-aware brain.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Each environment is a connector to the same intelligence, safety, and delivery system.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Eighteen minutes into a difficult run, heart rate reaches 170 and effort exceeds 85 percent.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The system waits for a safe recovery window instead of interrupting mid-stride.

7
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:20,000
A quiet private cue reveals Scripture without taking the runner out of the experience.

8
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:35,000
A connector first normalizes raw signals into one typed context contract.

9
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Gloo AI Studio returns need, bounded theme, tone, and safety eligibility.

10
00:01:50,000 --> 00:02:00,000
YouVersion retrieves the canonical passage, then delivery policy selects timing and privacy.

11
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Explicit opt-in is required, and crisis signals route to human support.

12
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:25,000
Sensitive social moments never auto-post. The system does not diagnose or claim divine certainty.

13
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:35,000
The same brain can meet a player at respawn or a developer after a failed build.

14
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
It can support private human review or ground a creator during live pressure.

15
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:55,000
The prototype includes FastAPI, typed contracts, tests, CI, a public notebook, and live evidence capture.

16
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
The right word, inside the moment.
